window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>What happens when a Synth learns to love?</b></p> <p>LOVE thrusts Xane into the most powerful emotion yet: love. As she continues to understand human emotions, love proves to be a complex and intense challenge. Guided by River, Xane explores relationships, desire, and self-discovery, all while learning that love isn’t as straightforward as she thought. With multiple love interests, including the mysterious Levi and fellow musician Adrian, Xane is pulled in many directions, forcing her to question her identity and emotions.</p> <p>This fourth volume builds on Xane’s growing emotional awareness, setting up the ultimate test—how will she manage the darker, more volatile emotions still to come?</p> <p>The XANE series takes listeners on an unforgettable journey of emotional discovery, blending sci-fi adventure with themes of self-awareness and personal growth. Each volume deepens Xane’s understanding of what it means to be human, leading to a thrilling, emotionally charged conclusion.</p> <p>Perfect for fans of Neal Shusterman’s Arc of a Scythe series, Marissa Meyer’s The Lunar Chronicles, Lauren Oliver’s Replica duology, and recent hits like K. Ancrum’s The Weight of the Stars and Mira Grant’s A Dowry of Blood, the XANE series will captivate YA sci-fi listeners who love stories about emotional intelligence, transformation, and the complexities of the human experience.</p>"; 
